From 8d838a560d1d38f0f7f4bbf160a61d03593c6f68 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ifran Ali <khanu.i.i.k.2000@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 13:20:28 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 1072/1072] airoha: en751221: add TP-Link XZ000-G3 v2

EN7521S GPON SFU: 64 MiB in-package DDR2, 4 MiB EN25QH32 SPI-NOR, one
GbE port on switch port 4, reset button on GPIO 0, PON LED on GPIO 2
and LOS LED on GPIO 7.

U-Boot is LZMA compressed behind the airoha_mips_dramc early stages, so
the bootloader fits in 256 KiB. The stock factoryinfo and loid blocks
are merged into one factory block after it, and the firmware (FIT and
rootfs) follows at 0x50000. migrate_layout moves a stock board to this
layout, checking the factory data before anything is erased.

upgrade_uboot and migrate_layout only erase the boot area once the image
passes its checks: size, tcboot magic, the CRC over the early stages and
the magic, load address, type and data CRC of the U-Boot uImage.
install_openwrt checks that the image fits the firmware partition before
erasing it.

The environment is built in. The MAC comes from factory at preboot and
holding reset at power-on boots from TFTP.

Signed-off-by: Ifran Ali <khanu.i.i.k.2000@gmail.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
